                                "example_id": "3ba0b560-0ee9-447f-b78d-d6a17f99d19e",
                                "sense_id": "1f0536b0-986c-358e-ab13-851f762e3c60",
                                "text": "I thought back to my father’s manual and the line drawings of body parts. I thought of my bosses and lost boyfriends, of passion and mispassion. Then I told her the truth, about penises and where they fit into women, about eggs and sperm and embryos."
